{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "600dce1ad8a01ce81cfca88401c4c3480ba2930db90fc6d9bab3d39bc8aef06e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、回診の時間です。\n今日の心音は普通ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，查房时间到了。\n今天的心跳声正常吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8c67c47a96ffc84b99ab0fad900b4fb72c03c4299d80bffcce17bb37b858746", "ja": "お疲れ、麗花……えっと、かいしん……しんおん？", "zh": "辛苦了，丽花……那个，巡诊……心音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "7230fa3543c9fa93ad92b1303a1819956a05f0f56134309404430bd250f9873d", "ja": "はい、お医者さんごっこです！　最近、みんなに\n「お医者さんの役、すごかったね」ってよく言われて。", "zh": "是医生扮演游戏！最近大家经常对我说：\n“你演医生演得真棒呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1003_p", "source_sha256": "09afe4666f7fc6a37ac592ec7611f8d8ba51800e9582a6e2a1d6c506374fe0b0", "ja": "お医者さん……ああ！　もしかして、廃病院で\nお化けドクターを演じたときのことかな？", "zh": "医生……啊！难道是指在废弃医院里扮演幽灵医生的那次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "60999d2137eb84d82d82227e508a10c0be709f664462de8c9200346dc62208da", "ja": "それです。私、お医者さんの才能もあったみたいで。\nだから、みんなを健康にしちゃおうかなって♪", "zh": "就是那个。看来我还有当医生的才能呢。所以，我想不如让大家都变得健健康康的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e40b0d015ecccaefd041e09030939907d116eab31cdcf037d90f94ce887c1df", "ja": "それでお医者さんごっこ……。でもな、麗花。みんなは\nお化けの演技がすごいって感心したんだと思うよ。", "zh": "所以才玩医生游戏……不过啊，丽花，我想大家是佩服你演鬼演得很厉害吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "76bbaaa8d90cc87ce2e25ac5d2f46d29d15ec837dbb988abc05660cff9c2ddf0", "ja": "ええっ、そうだったんですか～！？　でもそれって、\n怖いお医者さんは大成功だったってことですよね♪", "zh": "诶～，原来是这样吗～！？不过这也就是说，恐怖医生大获成功了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "2104bca7e1435bfeafc3b55dd13a9902fb843da1defcce8c5e0c5f3603170a14", "ja": "ホラー映画をいっぱい見て研究したかいがありました！\nお仕事中も、たくさん驚かれちゃいましたし♪", "zh": "多亏我看了好多恐怖电影来研究，真是值得呢！\n工作的时候，也把好多人都吓了一跳呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f9e0713409880d85f722aa6a84d0a57ae5fd75a2c36a109568607ca0063b87ed", "ja": "あはは……。かなり迫力があったな。\n本気で怖がってたスタッフさんもいたくらい……。", "zh": "啊哈哈……确实很有魄力。\n甚至还有工作人员被吓得不轻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "b6a587093ccc145056b5ef8b39ea70fcca63fbe97fdf4b76377898fbb08304a2", "ja": "えへへ♪　ありがとうございます！\n{$P$}さん。ここでクイズです！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪谢谢您！\n{$P$}先生。现在来猜个谜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0c9b26aecc88b5cf7efecc1f6a2ffdbc4d800d8fef55c7f71e30a4f867d0e881", "ja": "クイズ？　なんだか突然だな……。", "zh": "问答？怎么突然来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "9e0d11e9cff8d18fcf53697fb0d054d5149fd2d6e86c46b79db36168b94de477", "ja": "私が怖いものは滑落と遭難……\nさて、あと一つはなんでしょ～かっ！", "zh": "我害怕的东西是坠落和迷路……\n那么，最后一个是什么呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f1ef45df2db4aa8641fba8948f30fdd8172d12c19ba9e62aee7127c871237764", "ja": "その流れで怖いものとなると……。\nうーん、急な病気……とかかな？", "zh": "顺着这个思路来说，害怕的东西就是……  \n嗯——突发疾病……之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "07008d1dd9d340061554e8db372549c68d09aeeb31634b8f201216a07e6dbca5", "ja": "ちょっと惜しかったですね。正解は～……\n{$P$}さんと離れること、でした！", "zh": "差一点就猜中了。正确答案是～……\n就是和{$P$}先生分开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "6e34a0f0e91d120be3ac35c510ccfd871138caa47a6d05b79c68c554b9e8268d", "ja": "{$P$}さんがいなくなると思うと、\n胸がきゅっとなって……だから元気でいてくださいね？", "zh": "想到{$P$}先生不在了，\n心里就会紧紧地揪起来……所以请一定要健健康康的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1015_p", "source_sha256": "180c6fa8f88a7bf77b504f92f91ef7090b3d945198471bab38d4e294a3849d97", "ja": "そ、そうか。……もちろん、麗花やみんなを\nトップアイドルにするまで元気でいるつもりだよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。……当然，在把丽花和大家培养成顶尖偶像之前，我会一直保持健康的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0673_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6efbece8e727bf03760d241b21264dd96e67546dc2381bcd3190bbf1d8b32cc", "ja": "絶対に、約束ですよ！　急な不整脈も怖いので\n私が毎日、健康診断しちゃいます。いいですよね♪", "zh": "一定要答应我哦！突然发生心律不齐也很可怕，所以我每天都来给你做健康检查。可以吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
